{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00401","headline":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 凯安 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 中宗祀昊天乐章 凯安","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"堂堂圣祖兴，赫赫昌基泰。\n戎车盟津偃，玉帛涂山会。\n舜日啓祥晖，尧云卷征斾。\n风猷被有截，声教覃无外。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}